import PageLayout from "../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout title="Troubleshooting — TotalRecalls" description="Troubleshooting TotalRecalls setup and usage." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Guides", href: "/guides/" }, { label: "Troubleshooting" }]}>
  <h1>Troubleshooting</h1>
  <h2>Download Fails or Returns Empty</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Make sure the provider's sign-in window completed a real login — the
      app reads the live session from that embedded window, not from your
      default browser.</li>
    <li>Some providers' servers are occasionally slow or return errors. If
      the app shows "servers are busy — retrying", wait for the retry to
      finish (it will keep going; large accounts take longer).</li>
    <li>If the sign-in window opens blank and never loads, close the app and
      launch it again — the app clears leftover browser processes on startup.</li>
    <li>Disconnect and reconnect (the provider's "Disconnect", then "Connect"
      again) to force a fresh login window.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>SmartScreen Blocks the App</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>See the <a href="/guides/smartscreen/">SmartScreen Help</a> guide.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Google Takeout Import Fails</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Ensure you downloaded the full ZIP from <a href="https://takeout.google.com">takeout.google.com</a>.</li>
    <li>Extract the ZIP before importing—TotalRecalls reads the extracted folder.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Still Need Help?</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@totalrecalls.app">support@totalrecalls.app</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
